WEBVTT

21:01.203 --> 21:03.705
I wonder if the old gods agree.

21:04.957 --> 21:06.834
It's your gods with all the rules.

21:13.590 --> 21:15.926
I am so sorry, my love.

21:17.052 --> 21:20.681
- Tell me.
- There was a raven from King's Landing.

21:22.808 --> 21:24.351
Jon Arryn is dead.

21:24.476 --> 21:26.979
A fever took him.

21:29.898 --> 21:32.025
I know he was like a father to you.
